<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:50:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>市场中值得庆幸的一件事</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</link><description>国债对冲再次发挥作用。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for'&gt;市场中值得庆幸的一件事&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：One Thing In Markets To Be Thankful For&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>CoreWeave 的银行下周将出售 45 亿美元的元挂钩贷款</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 的摩根士丹利和三菱日联金融集团银行家最快将于下周准备出售 45 亿美元的贷款，融资由 Meta Platforms Inc. 的图形处理部门提供担保。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week'&gt;CoreWeave 的银行下周将出售 45 亿美元的元挂钩贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave’s Banks to Sell $4.5 Billion Meta-Tied Loan Next Week&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:25:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</link><description>BC Partners 的信贷部门已同意购买 GSE Worldwide 的多数股权，GSE Worldwide 是一家体育营销机构，代表高尔夫名人布赖森·德尚博 (Bryson DeChambeau) 和前 NFL 和 MLB 球星博·杰克逊 (Bo Jackson) 等运动员。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list'&gt;BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BC Partners Buys GSE Agency With Golfer DeChambeau on List&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Slumps as AI Worries Fuel Selloff in Tech Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>摩根大通支持无人机发动机制造商在威斯康星州的市政出售</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jpmorgan-backs-drone-engine-maker-s-10-million-muni-bond-sale</link><description>一家无人机发动机制造商在美国市政债券市场首次亮相，债务背后有一个熟悉的名字：摩根大通公司。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jpmorgan-backs-drone-engine-maker-s-10-million-muni-bond-sale'&gt;摩根大通支持无人机发动机制造商在威斯康星州的市政出售&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：JPMorgan Backs Drone Engine Maker’s Muni Sale in Wisconsin&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jpmorgan-backs-drone-engine-maker-s-10-million-muni-bond-sale</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:02 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>